        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Fragment made of half silk with a tinted silk warp and a cotton weft. The fragment is woven with a broad stripe shaded from black-green to yellow one side, and a second stripe on the other side shaded from salmon pink to dark blue. This stripe is divided into triangular and lozenge-shaped divisions. The ground between the stripes is cream."@en ;
